("SL-L08","Native lateral-transfer and equivalent-title lists","state","NY (Civil Service Law 70.1/70.4 transfer lists)|MN (posting-named equivalent classes)|PA (cross-title qualifying experience)","Civil-service rules list titles whose experience qualifies for lateral transfer or as qualifying experience.","These are state-validated skill-adjacency judgments: a gold set for EMST transferability metrics (CM) and NLP mapping (IA).","E","SL-062|SL-069|SL-080"),
