("SL-L14","WIOA reauthorization: A Stronger Workforce for America Act of 2026 (H.R. 8210)","multi","Federal (affects all state and local boards)","Introduced 2026-04-06; ordered reported 19-14 (party line) on 2026-04-21; no floor vote or Senate companion found as of late July 2026. Provisions: 50% of Adult/DW funds to training; governor reserve up to 25%; single-area designation options; flat authorizations, DW -4.5%; adult education moved to DOL. WIOA has not been reauthorized since 2014.","Plan for status-quo WIOA with more governor control if enacted. EMST adoption should not depend on reauthorization.","E","SL-001|SL-002|SL-003|SL-004|SL-005|SL-006|SL-007"),
